infinite-patch 1
# Polivoks Dual Op-Amp Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 45
  i note1 45
  i note2 48
  i note3 45
  i note4 50
  i note5 45
  i note6 52
  i note7 48
  i note8 45
  i note9 57
  i note10 55
  i note11 52
  i note12 50
  i note13 48
  i note14 45
  i note15 43
  b en0 1
  b en1 1
